---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="CareBridge Health – Medical Tourism & Hair Transplant in India"
  description="CareBridge Health connects international patients with India's top hospitals for hair transplant, dental and cosmetic treatments. End-to-end coordination, transparent pricing."
  canonical="https://carebridge-health.com"
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-20 md:pb-20">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <!-- TEXT FIRST, IMAGE SECOND ON MOBILE -->
      <div class="order-1">
        <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight xl:tracking-tighter">
          We Don't Just Book.<br />
          <span class="text-blue-600">We Audit.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-xl">
          Most medical tourism agencies are just middlemen. CareBridge physically inspects every clinic for safety, hygiene, and pricing. 
          Get UK-quality treatment for 70% less.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919994581853"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-white font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition"
          >
            <span>Get Free Quote via WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IMAGE VISIBLE ON ALL DEVICES -->
      <div class="order-2">
        <img
          src="/doctor-india.jpg"
          alt="Doctor performing surgery in India"
          class="rounded-lg shadow-xl w-full h-auto"
          width="600"
          height="400"
        />
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- 1️⃣ Popular Treatments Section -->
  <section class="container mx-auto px-5 mt-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
      Treatments we help you with
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      CareBridge Health coordinates safe, high-quality treatment in India for
      international patients. We focus on a few procedures we understand well.
    </p>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a
        href="/hair-transplant"
        class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-white transition"
      >
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Hair Transplant</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          FUE / DHI hair restoration with natural hairline design and clear
          graft-count planning.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-blue-700">
          Learn more →
        </p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/dental"
        class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-white transition"
      >
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Dental &amp; Smile Makeover</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          Implants, crowns, veneers and full-mouth rehab in modern dental centres.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-blue-700">
          Learn more →
        </p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/cosmetic"
        class="block rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-white transition"
      >
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Selected Cosmetic Procedures</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          Carefully chosen surgeons for a small list of safe, evidence-based
          cosmetic surgeries.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-blue-700">
          Learn more →
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2️⃣ How CareBridge works (Process Section) -->
  <section class="container mx-auto px-5 mt-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
      How CareBridge works – in 5 simple steps
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      We are not a hospital. We’re your coordination team between home and the
      right hospital in India.
    </p>

    <ol class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-5 text-sm text-slate-700">
      <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700">Step 1</p>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mt-1 mb-1">Free WhatsApp chat</h3>
        <p>Send us your history and goals. We’ll tell you if it even makes sense to proceed.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700">Step 2</p>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mt-1 mb-1">Doctor review</h3>
        <p>A partner specialist reviews your photos/reports and suggests a plan.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700">Step 3</p>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mt-1 mb-1">Transparent quote</h3>
        <p>You see approximate cost, stay length and what is / isn’t included.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700">Step 4</p>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mt-1 mb-1">Travel &amp; treatment</h3>
        <p>We help with dates, airport pick-up and support during your hospital visit.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700">Step 5</p>
        <h3 class="font-semibold mt-1 mb-1">Follow-up at home</h3>
        <p>After you fly back, we stay in touch for basic follow-up and questions.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- 3️⃣ Why patients use CareBridge (Benefits + Trust) -->
  <section class="container mx-auto px-5 mt-16 mb-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
          Why international patients like working with us
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
          Flying abroad for treatment can feel risky. Our job is to remove as many
          unknowns as possible before you book a ticket.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 text-sm">
          <li>✔ Clear written plan and price range before you travel.</li>
          <li>✔ Focus on a few procedures instead of “everything for everyone”.</li>
          <li>✔ Help choosing realistic options – not pushing the most expensive package.</li>
          <li>✔ Communication over WhatsApp, email and video calls.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Who we are a good fit for</h3>
        <p>
          You’re a good match for CareBridge if you’re serious about treatment,
          want clear information, and are okay with honest answers – even if that
          means we say “not a good idea” or “wait for now”.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you mostly want the <span class="font-semibold">cheapest</span> or
          <span class="font-semibold">fastest</span> option, we’re probably not
          the right partner.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4️⃣ Final Strong CTA -->
  <section class="bg-blue-600 text-white py-10">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Ready to explore treatment options in India?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm mt-1">
          Send your case on WhatsApp. We’ll reply with a free assessment – no obligation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/919994581853?text=Hi%2C%20I%20want%20to%20know%20my%20options%20for%20treatment%20in%20India"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white text-blue-700 font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition"
      >
        Chat on WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
